{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a plane crash, Frank wakes up disoriented on a strange and dangerous island. Surviving the crash was only the beginning\u2014now he must endure the dangerous creatures that roam across the island and will give our protagonist more than one headache.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9d8b21d3d6740d6b18390745688b8069.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/d47b1b64a345d7dd94de6a5d7531cdd3.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENEMIES</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These dangerous creatures deal heavy damage when they bite and attack you. You will have different types of weapons to fight them, from a pistol to a knife. You will also have a shotgun, a crossbow, and a rifle, but you must manage your ammunition and inventory space wisely.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/50537e69a3e22a98276c262aaa248509.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP YOUR DISTANCE</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get too close, they will lunge at you and manage to bite you, but if you are quick, you can push them off and throw them away from you. Keeping them at a distance will be crucial for survival. Be very careful, as tall grass will sometimes make it difficult to spot them.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9ce866cffdea6982d476661643878c25.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every corner of the environments and find wooden barrels that you can break to obtain items inside. Exploration and resource gathering are crucial for survival in this experience. Inside you can find healing materials, ammunition for different weapons, money, and more.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your lighter to illuminate dark areas\u2014it will be useful in places filled with darkness.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/ab96ca37a88c3792dc2af577b5bfd1f8.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECTIBLES</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and find the collectible golden statuettes hidden throughout the game! There are 49 collectible figures waiting to be discovered!</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/29f263b8e0d0e83d602d3c8843176956.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, you will need to solve different puzzles to obtain important items that will help you progress through the story, as well as special keys.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/4850e291b4fc6fe7d73cfc3ca3ff839c.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE YOUR PROGRESS</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find old computers scattered across the island, where you can save your progress\u2014provided you have a diskette. Don\u2019t worry, there are diskettes spread throughout the areas, you just need to find them.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/d42af656570119b1e14b5e88f94f35fb.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also obtain money, which can be used in the island\u2019s vending machines as shops to purchase ammunition, weapons, and healing items. Money can be found in different game areas or in breakable barrels.</p>  <br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2919870?t=1760555930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2919870?t=1760555930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/dc33ee96380307e7070c3055cb657686bc9368cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760555930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/dc33ee96380307e7070c3055cb657686bc9368cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760555930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4068760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a plane crash, Frank wakes up disoriented on a strange and dangerous island. Surviving the crash was only the beginning\u2014now he must endure the dangerous creatures that roam across the island and will give our protagonist more than one headache.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9d8b21d3d6740d6b18390745688b8069.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/d47b1b64a345d7dd94de6a5d7531cdd3.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENEMIES</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These dangerous creatures deal heavy damage when they bite and attack you. You will have different types of weapons to fight them, from a pistol to a knife. You will also have a shotgun, a crossbow, and a rifle, but you must manage your ammunition and inventory space wisely.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/50537e69a3e22a98276c262aaa248509.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP YOUR DISTANCE</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get too close, they will lunge at you and manage to bite you, but if you are quick, you can push them off and throw them away from you. Keeping them at a distance will be crucial for survival. Be very careful, as tall grass will sometimes make it difficult to spot them.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/9ce866cffdea6982d476661643878c25.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every corner of the environments and find wooden barrels that you can break to obtain items inside. Exploration and resource gathering are crucial for survival in this experience. Inside you can find healing materials, ammunition for different weapons, money, and more.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your lighter to illuminate dark areas\u2014it will be useful in places filled with darkness.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/ab96ca37a88c3792dc2af577b5bfd1f8.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECTIBLES</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search and find the collectible golden statuettes hidden throughout the game! There are 49 collectible figures waiting to be discovered!</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/29f263b8e0d0e83d602d3c8843176956.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, you will need to solve different puzzles to obtain important items that will help you progress through the story, as well as special keys.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/4850e291b4fc6fe7d73cfc3ca3ff839c.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE YOUR PROGRESS</strong></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find old computers scattered across the island, where you can save your progress\u2014provided you have a diskette. Don\u2019t worry, there are diskettes spread throughout the areas, you just need to find them.</p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/extras/d42af656570119b1e14b5e88f94f35fb.avif?t=1760555930\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>  <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also obtain money, which can be used in the island\u2019s vending machines as shops to purchase ammunition, weapons, and healing items. Money can be found in different game areas or in breakable barrels.</p>  <br>","developers":["Cat Dreams Ar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919870/7c11ef427bfe4571c4908cd464c59b090d006ce5/header.jpg?t=1760555930","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2919870/1578199650/165668581129235f681560bcba5e38d036acbcd4/1758653951/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758672114","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2919870/1578199650/165668581129235f681560bcba5e38d036acbcd4/1758653951/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758672114","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2919870/1578199650/165668581129235f681560bcba5e38d036acbcd4/1758653951/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758672114","id":257204961,"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204961/3bcf5fa326d2f3c6c65f86980e222a65cb6e9e2c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758672114"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2919870/532312139/8acc1f2d81a619a0d39034010a3f61d5b6b393a1/1758324611/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758328435","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2919870/532312139/8acc1f2d81a619a0d39034010a3f61d5b6b393a1/1758324611/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758328435","high